    - rid: 3046479097160532275
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[NpcIdentity, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d1ed14cbae37a747a7aae1676868042, type: 2}
    - rid: 3046479097160532276
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[NpcIdentity, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a92984fab3971114f8ff115e44df5760, type: 2}
    - rid: 3046479097160532277
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532278
    - rid: 3046479097160532278
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Then do me a favour and remind him that I said MANY TIMES
          that I would be the one taking care of that: I''m not going to let anyone
          open that <b>door</b> before the moment comes, not even him.

          And
          make sure that he keeps in mind that he''s in debt with me, and that he''s
          still <b>alive</b> for a reason.'
        characterEmotion: 3
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 8
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532279
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -284.10843}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 3989213569
          Part2: 1292918822
          Part3: 1822912920
          Part4: 1958942294
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532279
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Roger that. (Wait... still alive?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3436, y: -284}
    - rid: 3046479097160532280
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532281
    - rid: 3046479097160532281
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...heh... yeah, you could say that. You see, we''ve done a
          lot of... "work" together and, while he was never too bright, I managed
          to... train him well.

          Thing is, I have... fallen out of love
          with the work I do, and with our... "boss"... but, see, that''s not something
          I can tell him without... hurting him.

          Luckily, if things go
          right, this should be the last time we work together. I''m looking forward
          to... "retirement".'
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532282
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2279.7, y: 422.81958}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1391464013
          Part2: 1202271727
          Part3: 3218864290
          Part4: 1059067647
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532282
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '["This"? So you''re working right now?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 3046479097160532283
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3335.9, y: 518.95}
    - rid: 3046479097160532283
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: '...in a way, yes. Which is why you should probably not get
          too involved in this.

          I''m here to complete a task, my last
          task... and I''m no longer going to doubt if I have to... change my "objectives".'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532284
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3749, y: 577.5}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2824955012
          Part2: 1279284701
          Part3: 1091494021
          Part4: 164643856
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532284
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(What''s going on here...?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4539, y: 578}
    - rid: 3046479097160532285
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532283
    - rid: 3046479097160532286
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532287
    - rid: 3046479097160532287
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Which is why you should stay away. We can''t afford to have
          people going around asking questions like that.

          Need I remind
          you that the whole reason why this works is the fact that <b>he</b> doesn''t
          know?

          I''m not going to risk it... I don''t want to keep working
          for <b>them</b>. This is my way out from all this, so please, step aside.'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 4
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532288
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3684.2007, y: 29.00001}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1053840211
          Part2: 1083319245
          Part3: 2245772943
          Part4: 1085929645
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532288
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[If you say so. (What''s he up to...?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4511.6006, y: 57.30004}
    - rid: 3046479097160532289
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532290
    - rid: 3046479097160532290
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Well, you''re the first and only person to come into this
          room, and the door to "the place" is still locked (despite people''s multiple
          attempts to get in), so nothing''s gone wrong so far.

          Though,
          of course, I didn''t account on you being a part of this so, please don''t
          get in the way.

          This is a very serious business for me, alright?'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 6
        doesItProveAnything: 8
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532291
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2239, y: -573.1084}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2757100495
          Part2: 1337091679
          Part3: 2331423645
          Part4: 1363973298
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532291
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Good to know. (What are you plotting?)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3346, y: -573}
    - rid: 3046479097160532292
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532293
    - rid: 3046479097160532293
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'What? That... doesn''t make any sense.

          Unless...
          oh no, was he scolding me for not doing my research properly?

          I
          swear i found everything I could about that guy... wait... I mean... science!
          We''re scientist doing research, that''s what I meant... um... yeah.'
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532294
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3102.5059, y: 810.482}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 209685302
          Part2: 1101052138
          Part3: 4035769758
          Part4: 1513944887
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532294
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(I doubt you''ve researched Oleg "for science"...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4146, y: 726.5}
    - rid: 3046479097160532295
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532296
    - rid: 3046479097160532296
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "\"The thing\"? Sorry, I don't think I know what that's supposed
          to mean.\nMan... are you guys already coming up with secret words without
          me? \nDamn it, I thought this would be the one place where I wouldn't feel
          <b>left out</b>..."
        characterEmotion: 2
        characterReaction: 7
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532297
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5193.805, y: 616.805}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2954009479
          Part2: 1319509012
          Part3: 1419098807
          Part4: 1616786135
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532297
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(That''s sad... but also very revealing...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5785.805, y: 616.805}
    - rid: 3046479097160532298
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[Item, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f243d9958ead79545b599d03db2e8738, type: 2}
    - rid: 3046479097160532299
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[Item, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2644e5ade1590fd48a3faefc742741ba, type: 2}
    - rid: 3046479097160532300
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532290
    - rid: 3046479097160532301
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532278
    - rid: 3046479097160532302
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532303
    - rid: 3046479097160532303
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "Oh, no, I cannot allow that, sir... even if I could get in,
          \nI wouldn't want to limit your experience here, but you have to understand:
          right now, it's not safe to go in without the right protection.\nThe temperature
          could be way off, a pipe could be perforated and leaking who-knows-what...
          it could be <b>fatal</b> if I let anyone in right now."
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532304
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3325.0005, y: 621}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 801171743
          Part2: 1177470563
          Part3: 1156241831
          Part4: 1806386512
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532304
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Makes sense. Thank you for warning me.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 4391, y: 565.7092}
    - rid: 3046479097160532305
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532306
    - rid: 3046479097160532306
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "So far, so good. The <b>target</b> has already gone upstairs,
          and the door to \"the place\" seems to be unlocked, so it should be easy
          to get him to fall for the <b>trap</b>. \nI've been really nice to everyone
          and no-one seems to suspect a thing.\nIf things keep going as planned,
          I'll be in there right before dinner, ready to <b>complete the task</b>..."
        characterEmotion: 4
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532307
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5204, y: 318}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 956334448
          Part2: 1168707074
          Part3: 985916342
          Part4: 2167441247
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532307
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[Great job. (<b>"Target"</b>? <b>Trap</b>? Hmm...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 6427.8394, y: 159}
    - rid: 3046479097160532308
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532296
    - rid: 3046479097160532309
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532310
    - rid: 3046479097160532310
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "And what better for that than a cozy hotel! \nWe all know
          that that business always take place in isolated, but seemingly innocuous
          places.\nTake the <b>sauna</b> upstairs, for instance... if it wasn't for
          the fact that the door won't budge, that would be perfect for negotiating.\nThey
          should have hung up the right sign, though.. my nose still hurts from trying
          to open it..."
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532311
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 5409, y: 145}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 2103101816
          Part2: 1171027430
          Part3: 1203153824
          Part4: 517255940
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532311
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[(Maybe that "business" is worth investigating...)]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 6266, y: 145}
    - rid: 3046479097160532312
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532313
    - rid: 3046479097160532313
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'There''s two men I haven''t seen since right after they checked
          in... who know what they might be doing upstairs.

          At the same
          time, there''s one man who went upstairs for just a minute, came back down
          and hasn''t left the dining hall since then.

          It seems like a
          weird thing, renting a room and not using it. As if he was avoiding whatever''s
          going on up there... or simply kept away by the ones upstairs...'
        characterEmotion: 0
        characterReaction: 0
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532314
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 7828, y: -271}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 1745687723
          Part2: 1246678443
          Part3: 2032475547
          Part4: 711998021
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532314
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[I guess that''s worth investigating... Thanks.]'
        nextNode:
          rid: -2
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 8816, y: -276}
    - rid: 3046479097160532315
      type: {class: 'ClueHolder`1[[DialogueNode, Assembly-CSharp]]', ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        m_clueTarget:
          rid: 3046479097160532316
    - rid: 3046479097160532316
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: "I wish that was the case... but where could I possibly go?
          The sauna won't open, the kitchen is locked as well. \nAnd I'm absolutely
          NOT going back in my bedroom, after all that <b>chaos</b> going on upstairs
          that I had to put up with for HOURS.\nAll that is left is this table, unless
          you can think of something better. "
        characterEmotion: 5
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532317
        isRootNode: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 2901.85, y: 492.00003}
        altDialoguePaths: []
        guid:
          Part1: 3403335406
          Part2: 1326432269
          Part3: 3950741638
          Part4: 921685745
        tag: 
    - rid: 3046479097160532317
      type: {class: DialogueResponse, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        responseText: '[<b>Chaos</b>? What do you mean?]'
        nextNode:
          rid: 3046479097160532318
        dialogueTopic: 
        m_conditions: []
        alreadyDisplayed: 0
        editorPosition: {x: 3767.0007, y: 455.3501}
    - rid: 3046479097160532318
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueText: 'Hah! Well, either there''s an invisible construction site
          next to this hotel, or someone near the suite <b>no. 1</b> has a really
          LOUD hobby.

          When I came to a place as desolated as this one,
          it''s because I was expecting to be away from the sounds of the city.

          But
          no: hammer strikes, drill roars, any industrial sound imaginable seems
          to follow me... and to think the host told me this was "her best room"...'
        characterEmotion: 1
        characterReaction: 2
        doesItProveAnything: 0
        isKey: 0
        responses:
        - rid: 3046479097160532319
        isRootNode: 0
